            "<li>Download publication-ready plots, filtered data, results workbook, and reproducible R code.</li>",
            "</ol>",
            "<p><b>Important:</b> The app supports exploration. Confirmatory analyses should follow a prespecified statistical plan and account for clustering and treatment allocation.</p>"
          )
        )
      )
    )
  )
)

